  // mist and bloom treat it as part of the actor. outlineWidth internal pixels thick (the
  // renderer sizes it to about OUTLINE_SCREEN_PX CSS pixels): rings of four axis taps at growing
  // distances, up to OUTLINE_TAPS of them spread over the width; width 1 is the original single
  // ring. The nearest ring that meets an actor wins, so the edge keeps that actor's depth.
